   C(2, "A courteous monster", "The Tartaro is oddly polite: he gives the boy a ring — a gift, and a leash. For the ring is enchanted: wherever the wearer goes, it calls out 'Here I am! Here I am!'", ["ring"], "obj.ring.gift"),
